# Deploy the site as static files only.
# With Framework Preset "python", Vercel mounted api/index.py as a ROOT
# catch-all function, so every page (/, /scoreboard.html, …) returned
# 404 {"error":"Not found."} from the legacy photo API instead of the
# static HTML. Nothing on the current site calls that legacy endpoint
# (it also has no env vars configured), so keep it in git but out of
# deployments until the photo flow is revived deliberately.
api/
